This PR brings 2 changes:

1. default value of `devServerMiddleware`, `static.watch` in  js_config/devServer;
2. refactor `rebuild` api in rspack-core

fixes #83

This rule update the Mock PHPDoc correctly:

```php
class MyClassTest extends TestCase {
    /**
     * @var MyClass
     */
    private $my;
    
    /**
     * @var ObjectProphecy
     */
    private $my2;

    public function setUp(): void
    {
         $this->my = $this->prophesize(MyClass::class);
         $this->my2 = $this->prophesize(MyClass::class);
    }
}
```

it depends on the call of `$this->prophesize`:

```php
class MyClassTest extends TestCase {
    /**
     * @var ObjectProphecy<MyClass>
     */
    private $my;
    
    /**
     * @var ObjectProphecy<MyClass>
     */
    private $my2;

    public function setUp(): void
    {
         $this->my = $this->prophesize(MyClass::class);
         $this->my2 = $this->prophesize(MyClass::class);
    }
}
```

Also `ObjectProphecy|MyClass` is upgraded to `ObjectProphecy<MyClass>` or other false typehints.

## 🧑‍🎓  About these notes

We study about how to make a tree transversal algorithm. We learn about the Depth First Search (preOrder, inOrder and posOrder), as well as the Breath First Search. With that in mind, we implemented a version of Binary tree that uses the BFS algorithm to add nodes into it, and also a example of BFS and DFS algorithms that iterates a trees and saves the order of nodes that it visited.

## 🔢  Changes

- Adding notes about tree transversal algorithms;
- Adding examples of tree transversal algorithms;
- Creating a Binary tree structure;
- Refactoring some old tests so it all works properly;
